{"version":1,"content":"<p>北部都會區馬拉松2026明日（11月1日）舉行，石門、龍山隧道北行及粉嶺繞道南行多處路段，凌晨2時起分階段封閉。</p><p>港鐵東鐵線及屯馬線部分路段提早開出首班車，7條巴士及2條專線小巴路線亦有調整。</p><p>【詳情】</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:12.036075+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":101,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T09:15:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T04:17:57.794608+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.064602+00:00","content_hash":"31d6731302775c676170de4a32b6d687ae3a4f5557f8803c3b7524ad64bb2128","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}